WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.010
Brad: I hope they’re all right.

2
00:00:15.011 --> 00:00:21.374
Tina: Let’s try to crack the ice!

3
00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.944
Danny: This won’t work!

4
00:00:23.945 --> 00:00:26.269
Brad: We need to melt the ice!

5
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:30.238
Tina: It’s too cold up here on the mountaintop.

6
00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:32.643
Brad: The sun is so gray.

7
00:00:32.644 --> 00:00:35.701
It’s not very bright or warm.

8
00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:39.045
Danny: The sun! We need to color the sun.

9
00:00:39.046 --> 00:00:45.189
Danny: Stand back, I’ve got a sun to make.

10
00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:47.270
Danny: You’re stronger than I am.

11
00:00:47.271 --> 00:00:48.900
You should throw it.

12
00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:52.630
Tina: But my imagination’s not as good as yours.

13
00:00:52.631 --> 00:00:54.344
Danny: That’s okay.

14
00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:57.827
We’ll all imagine together. Ready, Brad?

15
00:00:57.828 --> 00:00:59.359
Brad: I’m with you.

16
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:05.638
Let’s do it!

17
00:01:05.639 --> 00:01:08.094
Danny: Ready?

18
00:01:08.095 --> 00:01:15.001
Tina: One, two, three . . .

19
00:01:15.002 --> 00:01:19.805
Danny: Great throw, Tina.

20
00:01:19.806 --> 00:01:27.501
Brad: Did it make it?

21
00:01:27.502 --> 00:01:28.678
Danny: You did it!

22
00:01:28.679 --> 00:01:30.366
I knew you could!

23
00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:31.717
Tina: We did it!

24
00:01:31.718 --> 00:01:37.324
All of us together!

25
00:01:37.325 --> 00:01:39.753
Brad: Look what’s happening everywhere!

26
00:01:39.754 --> 00:01:41.038
Danny: We’ve done it!

27
00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:48.454
We’ve saved Ginormous!

28
00:01:48.455 --> 00:01:50.420
Tina: The ice is melting!

29
00:01:50.421 --> 00:01:55.511
Just another minute or two and they’ll be free.

30
00:01:55.512 --> 00:01:58.806
Tristay: Not so fast, you troublemakers!

31
00:01:58.807 --> 00:02:01.190
Danny: You’re too late, Tristay!

32
00:02:01.191 --> 00:02:03.474
The sun is up in the sky.

33
00:02:03.475 --> 00:02:06.860
Danny: All the color has returned to Ginormous.

34
00:02:06.861 --> 00:02:12.727
Tristay: You children think that you have won, but you couldn’t be more wrong!

35
00:02:12.728 --> 00:02:19.342
Brad: We restored the color to the ocean, to the grass [n3@and flowers, and now to the sky.

36
00:02:19.343 --> 00:02:23.741
Tristay: Yes, and that will be a great help to me.

37
00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:27.704
Danny: Our colors destroyed all your evil creatures!

38
00:02:27.705 --> 00:02:30.481
Tristay: Yes, you did defeat my helpers.

39
00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:34.476
Tristay: But there’s a big difference between me and them.

40
00:02:34.477 --> 00:02:36.197
Tina: What’s that?

41
00:02:36.198 --> 00:02:40.106
Tristay: Color harms them, but color makes me powerful!

42
00:02:40.107 --> 00:02:43.865
Tristay: You have been helping me all along.

43
00:02:43.866 --> 00:02:46.077
Danny: I don’t understand.

44
00:02:46.078 --> 00:02:49.082
You wanted us to restore the color?

45
00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:52.793
Tristay: I realized that I needed more power to defeat you.

46
00:02:52.794 --> 00:02:57.092
Tristay: So I decided to let you complete your mission.

47
00:02:57.093 --> 00:03:01.893
Tristay: Now that color has returned to Ginormous, I can absorb it again.

48
00:03:01.894 --> 00:03:05.803
Tristay: I will become the most powerful giant ever!

49
00:03:05.804 --> 00:03:10.693
Danny: We were helping Hopian and the colorless giants, not you!

50
00:03:10.694 --> 00:03:12.485
Tristay: But you weren’t.

51
00:03:12.486 --> 00:03:16.314
You were helping me.

52
00:03:16.315 --> 00:03:18.073
Danny: It’s not true!

53
00:03:18.074 --> 00:03:20.172
Tristay: You know it’s true, Danny.

54
00:03:20.173 --> 00:03:21.961
Tristay: Look into your heart.

55
00:03:21.962 --> 00:03:25.378
You’re a bad boy yourself.

56
00:03:25.379 --> 00:03:27.586
Danny: No, I am not!

57
00:03:27.587 --> 00:03:30.658
Tristay: You are always getting into trouble at school.

58
00:03:30.659 --> 00:03:33.709
Tina: Leave him alone, you big bully.

59
00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.072
Brad: Danny just has an active imagination.

60
00:03:37.073 --> 00:03:40.857
Tristay: You have an active imagination and a wicked heart.

61
00:03:40.858 --> 00:03:43.898
Tristay: Of course you’re a bad boy, Danny.

62
00:03:43.899 --> 00:03:53.545
Tristay: My powers are about to grow even stronger, and it’s all thanks to you!
